PetroEdge AI database migrations
================================

Common commands (run from the backend directory):

  alembic current
  alembic history
  alembic upgrade head
  alembic downgrade -1
  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe the schema change"

Review every autogenerated revision before applying it. Alembic can detect most
schema changes, but renames are often represented as a drop plus an add and must
be corrected manually to preserve data.
